  "title": "Firefly Aerospace and Exolaunch Announce Launch Services Agreement",
  "summary": "CEDAR PARK, Texas–(BUSINESS WIRE)–Firefly Aerospace, Inc., a leading provider of economical and dependable launch vehicles, spacecraft, and in-space services, today announced a Launch Services Agreement with Exolaunch GmbH, a leading provider of launch services, mission management and separation systems, to integrate and launch multi-satellite clusters aboard Firefly’s Alpha launch vehicle beginning in 2022. Just weeks...",
